# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; this file is documentation.

# Required for the Options Scanner page only. The Intraday Stocks page runs on free
# Yahoo data and needs no key — without a Polygon key it simply falls back to
# conservative liquidity tiers instead of live quoted spreads when estimating cost.
# Real-time options data requires a Polygon plan that includes it.
POLYGON_API_KEY=

# Where the SQLite database lives. The default is deliberately outside the project
# directory: OneDrive and SQLite WAL files produce lock and sync conflicts that show up
# as "database is locked" mid-scan.
OPTIONS_DB_PATH=%LOCALAPPDATA%\StockOptionsCodex\options_screening.sqlite3
